        "nobel_worthiness": "Giant tunnel magnetoresistance established a central device principle for spintronics and enabled major advances in magnetic storage. The discovery has both fundamental and lasting technological significance.",
        "attribution": "Parkin and Yuasa represent independent experimental demonstrations; Butler's theory clarified the tunneling mechanism and its large spin dependence. The division of credit among experimental groups and theorists needs careful definition.",
        "maturity": "The effect and its technological consequences have been confirmed and developed over decades.",
