      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The prediction and experimental realization of topological insulators and quantum spin Hall behavior revealed robust new phases of matter and reshaped condensed matter physics.",
        "attribution": "Kane represents foundational theory, Molenkamp key quantum spin Hall experiments, and Xue experimental realization of the quantum anomalous Hall effect. These are related but distinct milestones, making a precise award citation important.",
