        "attribution": "Kitaev, Steane, and Shor made distinct foundational contributions to topological and code-based approaches. Their contributions are important but span several formulations of the broader idea.",
        "maturity": "The theory is mature and experimental demonstrations have advanced substantially, though large-scale fault-tolerant operation remains a major challenge.",
